@startuml US009_SSD
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
participant System

User -> System : Requests today's log
System --> User : Displays today's items grouped by meal and daily nutrition

group Change a logged quantity
    User -> System : Selects a logged item to change its quantity
    System --> User : Asks for the new quantity in the recorded unit
    User -> System : Provides a positive quantity
    System --> User : Confirms the quantity change and displays updated meal and daily nutrition
end

group Move a logged item
    User -> System : Selects a logged item to move
    System --> User : Displays supported destination meals
    User -> System : Selects the destination meal
    System --> User : Confirms the move and displays updated meal groupings and nutrition
end

group Delete a logged item
    User -> System : Selects a logged item and requests its deletion
    System --> User : Confirms the deletion and displays updated meals and daily nutrition
end

group Remove the remaining items individually
    loop For each remaining logged item
        User -> System : Selects a logged item and requests its deletion
        System --> User : Confirms the deletion and displays the updated daily view
    end
    System --> User : Displays an empty daily view after the final item is removed
end

@enduml
